# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to `.dockerignore`, which is the
# whole reason this file exists: the root `.dockerignore` excludes `web/` (the `api` image has
# no use for it), and this build compiles the frontend from the same context. Same exclusions
# otherwise, plus web's own build outputs.
.venv/
.git/
.omni/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
plans/
docs/
shots/
specs/
tests/
node_modules/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
web/*.tsbuildinfo
*.md
!README.md
